{"unit_id":"xiciyang__inference-serving#card-zh","repo":"xiciyang/inference-serving","commit":"779c913f5ee0065d8c1547b95a9c4984f3423430","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"inference-serving 是面向 DSH 的模型推理部署插件，通过 tools 服务注册部署和端点管理能力。它可探测本机环境并选择后端，将本地 checkpoint 部署为可访问的推理端点；部署完成前执行容器、模型端点和真实推理检查，失败时按配置调整资源并重试。用户还能查看和列出端点、回退到已验证版本、拆解部署、生成迁移计划及查看运行指标。适合需要在自己的 DSH 环境中管理模型推理服务的开发者。运行需要 Node.js、Linux 或 macOS；实际部署依赖兼容的容器与推理后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:24-58","src/tools.mjs:33-160","src/deploy.mjs:150-260","src/health.mjs:34-114"]}
{"unit_id":"xiciyang__inference-serving#card-en","repo":"xiciyang/inference-serving","commit":"779c913f5ee0065d8c1547b95a9c4984f3423430","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"inference-serving deploys model checkpoints as DSH inference endpoints. It checks the container and model responses, retries with adjusted resources, and provides endpoint inspection, rollback, cleanup, and migration planning. Requires Node.js and a compatible container backend.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:24-58","src/tools.mjs:33-160","src/deploy.mjs:150-260","src/health.mjs:34-114"]}
